(5058692, 737923, 22301, '<td valign="top">reminds me of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=34938" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">hotpasta</a>''s style of toning. I may have tried a tighter crop losing the building on the far right. I think this would have look interesting with each building escalating higher then the next. The light is very well balanced, but I do not think the border adds much to the presentation.</td>', 'reminds me of  hotpasta''s style of toning. I may have tried a tighter crop losing the building on the far right. I think this would have look interesting with each building escalating higher then the next. The light is very well balanced, but I do not think the border adds much to the presentation.', '2008-11-12 02:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
