(5059046, 738470, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think I might like this more if the rocks weren''t in the water in the foreground. They take away from the peaceful feeling of the water and sky and the vastness of the pic.</td>', 'I think I might like this more if the rocks weren''t in the water in the foreground. They take away from the peaceful feeling of the water and sky and the vastness of the pic.', '2008-11-12 08:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059048, 738257, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the framing and the idea, perhaps if the water were a little more saturated with color I would like it even more.</td>', 'I like the framing and the idea, perhaps if the water were a little more saturated with color I would like it even more.', '2008-11-12 08:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059051, 738064, 98141, '<td valign="top">Lighting is too harsh from flash and is distracting. Would prefer it on a different surface and perhaps with something more interesting going on with the apple (sliced up? paired with a bottle of wine?).</td>', 'Lighting is too harsh from flash and is distracting. Would prefer it on a different surface and perhaps with something more interesting going on with the apple (sliced up? paired with a bottle of wine?).', '2008-11-12 08:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059056, 737854, 98141, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous eyes. Feels a little like a floating head though, would prefer a little fill lighting to see some of her other shoulder.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous eyes. Feels a little like a floating head though, would prefer a little fill lighting to see some of her other shoulder.', '2008-11-12 08:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059060, 738513, 98141, '<td valign="top">Certainly meets the challenge and is a nice shot, something zen-like about it, but I think the ripples fall a little short of wowing, they feel a little flat, maybe not enough contrast?</td>', 'Certainly meets the challenge and is a nice shot, something zen-like about it, but I think the ripples fall a little short of wowing, they feel a little flat, maybe not enough contrast?', '2008-11-12 08:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059062, 737783, 98141, '<td valign="top">I just saw another droplet entry and this has the wow factor that that one was missing. I like the off-center placement of the droplet and the shadows. My only nitpick is the small bubble/spec on the side of the first ripple, it''s a little distracting, but is a minor thing and I think it''s a really cool picture.</td>', 'I just saw another droplet entry and this has the wow factor that that one was missing. I like the off-center placement of the droplet and the shadows. My only nitpick is the small bubble/spec on the side of the first ripple, it''s a little distracting, but is a minor thing and I think it''s a really cool picture.', '2008-11-12 08:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059066, 738695, 98141, '<td valign="top">To make the arms white, I think it would look better to use paint (facepaint from Halloween or something). Right now it kind of looks like a toilet-paper mummy is coming after the flower. I also think it would have worked well to spray the flower with something to make it shiny, like it was being frozen (which I think is the idea here). Cool idea, nice lighting effects, wish I could do that! Also would say to leave more room between the bottom of the glass and the frame.</td>', 'To make the arms white, I think it would look better to use paint (facepaint from Halloween or something). Right now it kind of looks like a toilet-paper mummy is coming after the flower. I also think it would have worked well to spray the flower with something to make it shiny, like it was being frozen (which I think is the idea here). Cool idea, nice lighting effects, wish I could do that! Also would say to leave more room between the bottom of the glass and the frame.', '2008-11-12 08:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059067, 738600, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think this would work better in a green challenge. Nice dof.</td>', 'I think this would work better in a green challenge. Nice dof.', '2008-11-12 08:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059069, 737823, 98141, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Calm. Nothing else to pick at. Love it.</td>', 'Beautiful! Calm. Nothing else to pick at. Love it.', '2008-11-12 08:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059070, 738482, 98141, '<td valign="top">Wow, fantastic. Great capture.</td>', 'Wow, fantastic. Great capture.', '2008-11-12 08:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059073, 737859, 98141, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, simple. I like the positioning of the moon in the frame. Don''t care much for the white frame around the pic.</td>', 'Nice shot, simple. I like the positioning of the moon in the frame. Don''t care much for the white frame around the pic.', '2008-11-12 08:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059076, 738507, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love square frames. I don''t think it works here, I''d like to have more of the smoke included and have the tray closer to the bottom of the frame.</td>', 'I love square frames. I don''t think it works here, I''d like to have more of the smoke included and have the tray closer to the bottom of the frame.', '2008-11-12 08:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059077, 738009, 98141, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t feel very crisp, would like it if it were sharper and would like a little more exposure, feel a little dark.</td>', 'Doesn''t feel very crisp, would like it if it were sharper and would like a little more exposure, feel a little dark.', '2008-11-12 08:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059078, 738584, 98141, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure what I''m looking at. Too dark.</td>', 'I''m not really sure what I''m looking at. Too dark.', '2008-11-12 08:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059083, 738566, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think you did a good job with the composition on this one. Window isn''t sharp enough for me.</td>', 'I think you did a good job with the composition on this one. Window isn''t sharp enough for me.', '2008-11-12 08:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059085, 737354, 98141, '<td valign="top">It looks like a little person coming out of the water. Reminds me of evolution somehow. I love the contrast with the black background.</td>', 'It looks like a little person coming out of the water. Reminds me of evolution somehow. I love the contrast with the black background.', '2008-11-12 08:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059086, 738537, 96653, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but just doesn''t work for Blue...</td>', 'Nice idea but just doesn''t work for Blue...', '2008-11-12 08:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059087, 737575, 98141, '<td valign="top">Love the reflections in the windows. Nice composition.</td>', 'Love the reflections in the windows. Nice composition.', '2008-11-12 08:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059088, 737395, 98141, '<td valign="top">Composition is messy. Feels like a snapshot.Would have cropped so the paddle was covering the whole corner at least. Or taken the paddle out of the shot completely.</td>', 'Composition is messy. Feels like a snapshot.Would have cropped so the paddle was covering the whole corner at least. Or taken the paddle out of the shot completely.', '2008-11-12 08:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059093, 738563, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like her dark hair and the way it looks underwater. The rest of it I don''t get. Is she dead in the water? I think makeup could have been manipulated to convey that better if that is the case.</td>', 'I like her dark hair and the way it looks underwater. The rest of it I don''t get. Is she dead in the water? I think makeup could have been manipulated to convey that better if that is the case.', '2008-11-12 08:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059107, 738001, 98141, '<td valign="top">Good composition.</td>', 'Good composition.', '2008-11-12 08:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059108, 737497, 98141, '<td valign="top">Cool, but feels oof.</td>', 'Cool, but feels oof.', '2008-11-12 08:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059109, 738121, 98141, '<td valign="top">Simple, lovely, but feels like a graphic.</td>', 'Simple, lovely, but feels like a graphic.', '2008-11-12 08:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059110, 738693, 98141, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, good capture, but no wow points for creativity.</td>', 'Nice composition, good capture, but no wow points for creativity.', '2008-11-12 08:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059113, 737959, 98141, '<td valign="top">Oof, and loaded very small, try to get as close to the mb limit as you can. Good street shot.</td>', 'Oof, and loaded very small, try to get as close to the mb limit as you can. Good street shot.', '2008-11-12 08:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059114, 737663, 98171, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo! It looks like the blue heron is posing for you. Love this picture.</td>', 'Awesome photo! It looks like the blue heron is posing for you. Love this picture.', '2008-11-12 08:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059116, 738090, 98141, '<td valign="top">The bit in the upper right corner is distracting.</td>', 'The bit in the upper right corner is distracting.', '2008-11-12 08:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059119, 738302, 98141, '<td valign="top">Cool, nothing to pick about really.</td>', 'Cool, nothing to pick about really.', '2008-11-12 08:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059120, 738587, 98141, '<td valign="top">Lovely autumn portrait.</td>', 'Lovely autumn portrait.', '2008-11-12 08:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059121, 738555, 98141, '<td valign="top">Delicate, lovely, don''t care for the white border.</td>', 'Delicate, lovely, don''t care for the white border.', '2008-11-12 08:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059122, 738278, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think a little more blue would have done this good, but it''s a nice capture, good contrast, and good job not making the big lights too bright.</td>', 'I think a little more blue would have done this good, but it''s a nice capture, good contrast, and good job not making the big lights too bright.', '2008-11-12 08:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059125, 738083, 98141, '<td valign="top">Blown out.</td>', 'Blown out.', '2008-11-12 08:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059127, 738025, 98141, '<td valign="top">Feels oof but I am jealous of how warm it looks.</td>', 'Feels oof but I am jealous of how warm it looks.', '2008-11-12 09:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059130, 738149, 98171, '<td valign="top">I think your crop is a little too tight here. I understand that you may have taken the picture sideways to get the whole door in the image... If you were going to crop it this tight, maybe you should have cropped the top of the image out where there''s a white frame on top.</td>', 'I think your crop is a little too tight here. I understand that you may have taken the picture sideways to get the whole door in the image... If you were going to crop it this tight, maybe you should have cropped the top of the image out where there''s a white frame on top.', '2008-11-12 09:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059132, 737123, 98141, '<td valign="top">Interesting pov, but don''t care for the composition (the stalks right in the center of the frame are not ideally placed, try moving them more to one side).</td>', 'Interesting pov, but don''t care for the composition (the stalks right in the center of the frame are not ideally placed, try moving them more to one side).', '2008-11-12 09:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059133, 738617, 98141, '<td valign="top">Very colorful but the blur makes it lose some of its impact imo.</td>', 'Very colorful but the blur makes it lose some of its impact imo.', '2008-11-12 09:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059136, 738653, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great droplet shot, I like that we see more than one in the fall, nice colors.</td>', 'Great droplet shot, I like that we see more than one in the fall, nice colors.', '2008-11-12 09:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059137, 738263, 98141, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2008-11-12 09:02:46.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5059138, 738387, 98141, '<td valign="top">Light is too harsh from flash, warning label is distracting in upper left.</td>', 'Light is too harsh from flash, warning label is distracting in upper left.', '2008-11-12 09:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059139, 738641, 98141, '<td valign="top">Would have liked this better for the abandoned challenge, but think this is a cool shot. Sink feels a little oof.</td>', 'Would have liked this better for the abandoned challenge, but think this is a cool shot. Sink feels a little oof.', '2008-11-12 09:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059140, 738511, 98141, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, would prefer a smidge more space from his foot to the frame on the bottom.</td>', 'Nice lighting, would prefer a smidge more space from his foot to the frame on the bottom.', '2008-11-12 09:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059141, 738695, 98171, '<td valign="top">Wish there was more blue coming off your hand. But still, this is a great image.</td>', 'Wish there was more blue coming off your hand. But still, this is a great image.', '2008-11-12 09:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059143, 737653, 98141, '<td valign="top">Don''t care for the white covering only part of the background.</td>', 'Don''t care for the white covering only part of the background.', '2008-11-12 09:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059144, 737833, 98141, '<td valign="top">Oof and looks black and yellow to me, not blue?</td>', 'Oof and looks black and yellow to me, not blue?', '2008-11-12 09:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059148, 738036, 98141, '<td valign="top">Cool makeup, wish her nose were a little more in focus.</td>', 'Cool makeup, wish her nose were a little more in focus.', '2008-11-12 09:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059149, 738655, 98141, '<td valign="top">Would like it more without the white cloud/smoke there.</td>', 'Would like it more without the white cloud/smoke there.', '2008-11-12 09:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059150, 738692, 98141, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, great colors.</td>', 'Nice composition, great colors.', '2008-11-12 09:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059155, 738049, 98141, '<td valign="top">Not really sure what I''m looking at here, and I kind of like that. If the spheres were alittle cleaner/not scratched I would like it even more, the particles are distracting. Great colors.</td>', 'Not really sure what I''m looking at here, and I kind of like that. If the spheres were alittle cleaner/not scratched I would like it even more, the particles are distracting. Great colors.', '2008-11-12 09:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059156, 738124, 98141, '<td valign="top">Would prefer if the part that was in focus was a little further away from the edge of the frame.</td>', 'Would prefer if the part that was in focus was a little further away from the edge of the frame.', '2008-11-12 09:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059157, 738097, 98141, '<td valign="top">If it''s one color only, would like it better without the cloud.</td>', 'If it''s one color only, would like it better without the cloud.', '2008-11-12 09:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059158, 738397, 98141, '<td valign="top">Interesting, a little too dark.</td>', 'Interesting, a little too dark.', '2008-11-12 09:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059160, 738602, 98141, '<td valign="top">Very cool lines. Great colors.</td>', 'Very cool lines. Great colors.', '2008-11-12 09:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059161, 738551, 98141, '<td valign="top">Good pic, no bonus points for creativity though.</td>', 'Good pic, no bonus points for creativity though.', '2008-11-12 09:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059162, 737575, 98171, '<td valign="top">Cant wait to see what editing you did to this image...</td>', 'Cant wait to see what editing you did to this image...', '2008-11-12 09:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059163, 738650, 98141, '<td valign="top">Cool, nice composition.</td>', 'Cool, nice composition.', '2008-11-12 09:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059165, 738621, 89723, '<td valign="top">You did not get my permission for this photo, but you''re lucky I''m in it. I see 5.0 in your future! Man, there are some ugly people in this shot. You should be charged with lens abuse!</td>', 'You did not get my permission for this photo, but you''re lucky I''m in it. I see 5.0 in your future! Man, there are some ugly people in this shot. You should be charged with lens abuse!', '2008-11-12 09:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059166, 738377, 98141, '<td valign="top">Would prefer if the eyes were a little further down from the frame, but I like the ruggedness of this.</td>', 'Would prefer if the eyes were a little further down from the frame, but I like the ruggedness of this.', '2008-11-12 09:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059168, 738077, 98141, '<td valign="top">Nice macro. Love the colors. Great use of focus.</td>', 'Nice macro. Love the colors. Great use of focus.', '2008-11-12 09:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059172, 738497, 98141, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective, would prefer if a little more of the base of the stalks were in focus.</td>', 'Interesting perspective, would prefer if a little more of the base of the stalks were in focus.', '2008-11-12 09:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059175, 737885, 98141, '<td valign="top">Would prefer if the rocks and pathway weren''t right in the middle of the frame.</td>', 'Would prefer if the rocks and pathway weren''t right in the middle of the frame.', '2008-11-12 09:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059177, 738593, 98141, '<td valign="top">Snapshot. Lighting is too harsh. Colors could use more saturation. Hard to tell that the plate is blue, looks black. Makes me hungry.</td>', 'Snapshot. Lighting is too harsh. Colors could use more saturation. Hard to tell that the plate is blue, looks black. Makes me hungry.', '2008-11-12 09:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059180, 738259, 98141, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, feels a little overexposed. Would like to see a version where a color in the middle was in focus rather than the one on the end.</td>', 'Cool idea, feels a little overexposed. Would like to see a version where a color in the middle was in focus rather than the one on the end.', '2008-11-12 09:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059181, 738544, 98141, '<td valign="top">Would like it more to see the shapes of some of the pieces rather than only their sides. Great colors. I like the blue border.</td>', 'Would like it more to see the shapes of some of the pieces rather than only their sides. Great colors. I like the blue border.', '2008-11-12 09:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059183, 738002, 98141, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, great title. Would prefer for the beam of light to be a little more off-center.</td>', 'Cool shot, great title. Would prefer for the beam of light to be a little more off-center.', '2008-11-12 09:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059184, 738287, 98141, '<td valign="top">Would suggest straigtening the horizon.</td>', 'Would suggest straigtening the horizon.', '2008-11-12 09:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059186, 737537, 98141, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t feel particularly blue to me, would suggest a different hue, but cool pic.</td>', 'Doesn''t feel particularly blue to me, would suggest a different hue, but cool pic.', '2008-11-12 09:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059187, 738631, 98141, '<td valign="top">Oof, not very blue.</td>', 'Oof, not very blue.', '2008-11-12 09:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059189, 738691, 98141, '<td valign="top">What''s blue here? The paint maybe? Looks greyish/whtie to me. Awkward composition. The handle right in the center isn''t appealing and the lock is too close to the edge.</td>', 'What''s blue here? The paint maybe? Looks greyish/whtie to me. Awkward composition. The handle right in the center isn''t appealing and the lock is too close to the edge.', '2008-11-12 09:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059190, 738216, 98141, '<td valign="top">Elegant, I like how the pages are more or less evenly spaced until the one on top.</td>', 'Elegant, I like how the pages are more or less evenly spaced until the one on top.', '2008-11-12 09:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059191, 738207, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the blackness of the treeline. Wish the tops of the trees were sharper.</td>', 'I like the blackness of the treeline. Wish the tops of the trees were sharper.', '2008-11-12 09:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059192, 738509, 98141, '<td valign="top">Her skin colors blend in too much with the sand tones behind her. Frame her face with her dark hair if there is a light colored background.</td>', 'Her skin colors blend in too much with the sand tones behind her. Frame her face with her dark hair if there is a light colored background.', '2008-11-12 09:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059194, 738357, 98141, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, don''t like the waterline running right through the center of the pic, would like to see a version with some of the reflection/water cut out.</td>', 'Cool shot, don''t like the waterline running right through the center of the pic, would like to see a version with some of the reflection/water cut out.', '2008-11-12 09:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059195, 738352, 98141, '<td valign="top">Wish the blossom were sitting on something of a different color, the bottom of the petals blends in too much.</td>', 'Wish the blossom were sitting on something of a different color, the bottom of the petals blends in too much.', '2008-11-12 09:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059196, 738675, 4493, '<td valign="top">Most thought evoking image so far. I like this. Good work!</td>', 'Most thought evoking image so far. I like this. Good work!', '2008-11-12 09:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059197, 737643, 98141, '<td valign="top">Yellow in the bottom right is distracting from... whatever this is.</td>', 'Yellow in the bottom right is distracting from... whatever this is.', '2008-11-12 09:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059198, 738114, 98141, '<td valign="top">Oof, but I like the composition. What''s the colors along the top? Light reflections? Distracting.</td>', 'Oof, but I like the composition. What''s the colors along the top? Light reflections? Distracting.', '2008-11-12 09:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059200, 738611, 98141, '<td valign="top">Nice dof, would prefer if it were sitting on a different surface.</td>', 'Nice dof, would prefer if it were sitting on a different surface.', '2008-11-12 09:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059207, 738462, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great reflection shot, the water is so still near the houses. Would like it more if the edge of the water were a little bit further from center, but a minor nitpick.</td>', 'Great reflection shot, the water is so still near the houses. Would like it more if the edge of the water were a little bit further from center, but a minor nitpick.', '2008-11-12 09:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059209, 738136, 98141, '<td valign="top">Cool, makes me feel like I''m Speed Racer.</td>', 'Cool, makes me feel like I''m Speed Racer.', '2008-11-12 09:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059213, 737989, 98141, '<td valign="top">Would like it more if it were sharper. Would like the top right corner to be filled with the ride. Cool shot.</td>', 'Would like it more if it were sharper. Would like the top right corner to be filled with the ride. Cool shot.', '2008-11-12 09:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059214, 738071, 98141, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors.</td>', 'Very nice colors.', '2008-11-12 09:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059217, 737353, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think I would like this better without the dark mass taking up the right half of the picture.</td>', 'I think I would like this better without the dark mass taking up the right half of the picture.', '2008-11-12 09:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
