(5059486, 738536, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like your lighting. This feels like an imprompteau self-portrait though, like it''s for Facebook. Can''t quite put my finger on why. I''ll come back to it later, just a comment for now, no score. ETA: Okay, I think that I would like it better if the face was more in focus. Normally we try to focus on eyes, but with sunglasses that''s hard to do, but I do wish her nose/mouth were a little more in focus.</td>', 'I like your lighting. This feels like an imprompteau self-portrait though, like it''s for Facebook. Can''t quite put my finger on why. I''ll come back to it later, just a comment for now, no score. ETA: Okay, I think that I would like it better if the face was more in focus. Normally we try to focus on eyes, but with sunglasses that''s hard to do, but I do wish her nose/mouth were a little more in focus.', '2008-11-12 10:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5059517, 738482, 98260, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!  I very much like the composition &amp; post processing of this.  Kudos to you!</td>', 'Gorgeous!  I very much like the composition & post processing of this.  Kudos to you!', '2008-11-12 11:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
