(5059680, 737114, 70107, '<td valign="top">no vote.<br/>but I would vote this low, and I thought you should know why.<br/>First off, exposure is off, and the lighting does not help this.<br/>There is barely any blue in this picture, not to mention green is the dominating colour. and the composition is non- existent really.<br/>I dont mean to be rude, I just figured you should know. <br/>Work on it next time!</td>', 'no vote.but I would vote this low, and I thought you should know why.First off, exposure is off, and the lighting does not help this.There is barely any blue in this picture, not to mention green is the dominating colour. and the composition is non- existent really.I dont mean to be rude, I just figured you should know. Work on it next time!', '2008-11-12 11:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
