(5060054, 738563, 41142, '<td valign="top">Hi!<br/> <br/>I still think this was a cool idea, and you showed a lot of dedication to pull it off!<br/> <br/>You edited this one since I last saw it? Or is this a different pic? Your face is much more red in this pic. I liked the desaturated one more. The red-purple looks a bit unnatural - edited or flushed, not dead. I see you decided not to crop it.<br/> <br/>Sorry for being so critical! Good luck with the voting!</td>', 'Hi! I still think this was a cool idea, and you showed a lot of dedication to pull it off! You edited this one since I last saw it? Or is this a different pic? Your face is much more red in this pic. I liked the desaturated one more. The red-purple looks a bit unnatural - edited or flushed, not dead. I see you decided not to crop it. Sorry for being so critical! Good luck with the voting!', '2008-11-12 13:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
