(5061690, 738411, 93565, '<td valign="top">I feel that the colors on this have too much contrast to them as a result of PP.</td>', 'I feel that the colors on this have too much contrast to them as a result of PP.', '2008-11-13 08:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061694, 738145, 93565, '<td valign="top">Not sure if it is just my monitor or not, but the clouds (lower right) seem to have noticeable artifacting. Composition is a bit too minimalist for my tastes.</td>', 'Not sure if it is just my monitor or not, but the clouds (lower right) seem to have noticeable artifacting. Composition is a bit too minimalist for my tastes.', '2008-11-13 08:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061695, 737106, 93565, '<td valign="top">The clothespin would benefit from more light. Also, stopping down for more DoF would help a bit.</td>', 'The clothespin would benefit from more light. Also, stopping down for more DoF would help a bit.', '2008-11-13 08:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061701, 736943, 93565, '<td valign="top">Looks a tad grainy. The use of a tripod/VR/IS/OIS... would have sharpened the silhouettes.</td>', 'Looks a tad grainy. The use of a tripod/VR/IS/OIS... would have sharpened the silhouettes.', '2008-11-13 08:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061713, 737999, 93565, '<td valign="top">Ha, this makes me think of a dialogue sequence from Fight Club. Anyway- Nice colors. Focus is pretty good too- I know these flowers can be somewhat difficult to get into focus due to their depth.</td>', 'Ha, this makes me think of a dialogue sequence from Fight Club. Anyway- Nice colors. Focus is pretty good too- I know these flowers can be somewhat difficult to get into focus due to their depth.', '2008-11-13 08:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061716, 738587, 93565, '<td valign="top">Great expression and pose. Border looks nice too. Might have liked to see a non-centered composition on this one, but still very nice.</td>', 'Great expression and pose. Border looks nice too. Might have liked to see a non-centered composition on this one, but still very nice.', '2008-11-13 08:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061719, 738194, 93565, '<td valign="top">Great pose. Only complaint is the tip of the beak isn''t in focus, but still great.</td>', 'Great pose. Only complaint is the tip of the beak isn''t in focus, but still great.', '2008-11-13 08:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061720, 738665, 93565, '<td valign="top">That is by far the coolest pigeon I''ve ever seen. Definition and color are fantastic. Beak slightly out of focus, however I think that is a minor complaint here.</td>', 'That is by far the coolest pigeon I''ve ever seen. Definition and color are fantastic. Beak slightly out of focus, however I think that is a minor complaint here.', '2008-11-13 08:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061721, 738221, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''m personally not a fan of the lighting. It feels like either a full harsh side lighting or a soft all around lighting needs to be chosen, and the two struggle against each other slightly.</td>', 'I''m personally not a fan of the lighting. It feels like either a full harsh side lighting or a soft all around lighting needs to be chosen, and the two struggle against each other slightly.', '2008-11-13 08:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061726, 738287, 93565, '<td valign="top">The crooked horizon kinda bugs me and distracts from the scene.</td>', 'The crooked horizon kinda bugs me and distracts from the scene.', '2008-11-13 09:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061735, 737895, 29513, '<td valign="top">This is just about perfect.  If I had to change anything, the skin tone seems to be the tiniest bit over exposed.  But I might not change anything.  8</td>', 'This is just about perfect.  If I had to change anything, the skin tone seems to be the tiniest bit over exposed.  But I might not change anything.  8', '2008-11-13 09:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061736, 737833, 93565, '<td valign="top">Not too sure about the background color... seems like the bra needs some more pop to the color.</td>', 'Not too sure about the background color... seems like the bra needs some more pop to the color.', '2008-11-13 09:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061738, 738121, 93565, '<td valign="top">I like the soothing colors of this. The blue isn''t nearly as intense as a lot of other entries, and is a lot easier on the eyes. I also really like how the definition gradually transitions from sharp to blur.</td>', 'I like the soothing colors of this. The blue isn''t nearly as intense as a lot of other entries, and is a lot easier on the eyes. I also really like how the definition gradually transitions from sharp to blur.', '2008-11-13 09:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061739, 737669, 93565, '<td valign="top">Give your poor lens/sensor a cleaning!</td>', 'Give your poor lens/sensor a cleaning!', '2008-11-13 09:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061740, 737616, 29513, '<td valign="top">Great idea to do the still life out doors.  Just about perfect. 8</td>', 'Great idea to do the still life out doors.  Just about perfect. 8', '2008-11-13 09:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061741, 736900, 93565, '<td valign="top">Cookie Monster has got some brutal lighting on him.</td>', 'Cookie Monster has got some brutal lighting on him.', '2008-11-13 09:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061747, 738462, 29513, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  I might have tried to increase the contrast just a bit during editing, though.  5</td>', 'Great idea.  I might have tried to increase the contrast just a bit during editing, though.  5', '2008-11-13 09:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061749, 737998, 93565, '<td valign="top">I find this to be a very soothing photo. The various colors work well together, especially with the blurred grass stems.</td>', 'I find this to be a very soothing photo. The various colors work well together, especially with the blurred grass stems.', '2008-11-13 09:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061755, 738675, 29513, '<td valign="top">Now, this is art.  A perfect visual interpretation of emotion.  Quite powerfully moving.  10.</td>', 'Now, this is art.  A perfect visual interpretation of emotion.  Quite powerfully moving.  10.', '2008-11-13 09:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061757, 738535, 93565, '<td valign="top">I rather like this. The textures are great, and it isn''t the crazy technicolor blue of a lot of other entries. Shame that closest bit is out of focus.</td>', 'I rather like this. The textures are great, and it isn''t the crazy technicolor blue of a lot of other entries. Shame that closest bit is out of focus.', '2008-11-13 09:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061760, 738611, 29513, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I might try to increase the contrast or saturation or both during editing, though.</td>', 'Nice composition.  I might try to increase the contrast or saturation or both during editing, though.', '2008-11-13 09:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061761, 737923, 93565, '<td valign="top">This is by far my favorite cityscape of the challenge. The blue tint is nice but not overwhelming. I like how the buildings completely fill the horizon.</td>', 'This is by far my favorite cityscape of the challenge. The blue tint is nice but not overwhelming. I like how the buildings completely fill the horizon.', '2008-11-13 09:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061763, 737923, 29513, '<td valign="top">It is hard to say what makes one of the city-scapes stand out from the others.  This is my favorite so far.  6</td>', 'It is hard to say what makes one of the city-scapes stand out from the others.  This is my favorite so far.  6', '2008-11-13 09:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061767, 737854, 29513, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I might of cropped a bit looser.  The blond hair on the blue material might be nice.  But those eyes. . . 7</td>', 'Nice.  I might of cropped a bit looser.  The blond hair on the blue material might be nice.  But those eyes. . . 7', '2008-11-13 09:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061768, 738090, 29513, '<td valign="top">Nice effect.  Almost looks like a globe hanging in the sky.  7.</td>', 'Nice effect.  Almost looks like a globe hanging in the sky.  7.', '2008-11-13 09:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061782, 738621, 29513, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  With all those stripes, you''d better get this right!  :)  But seriously, though, I might have bumped the contrast up just a bit in editing.</td>', 'Nice shot.  With all those stripes, you''d better get this right!  :)  But seriously, though, I might have bumped the contrast up just a bit in editing.', '2008-11-13 09:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061785, 738482, 29513, '<td valign="top">Wow!</td>', 'Wow!', '2008-11-13 09:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061789, 738184, 29513, '<td valign="top">Great energy and the exposure is right on. 7.</td>', 'Great energy and the exposure is right on. 7.', '2008-11-13 09:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061956, 738644, 96915, '<td valign="top">For the sake of honesty, I''m not really fond of the blue tint you put on an otherwise non-blue photo.  I get the mood, but the tint doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'For the sake of honesty, I''m not really fond of the blue tint you put on an otherwise non-blue photo.  I get the mood, but the tint doesn''t work for me.', '2008-11-13 12:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061960, 738535, 96915, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen a blueberry look so black.  I''d have liked to see this a little bluer.</td>', 'I''ve never seen a blueberry look so black.  I''d have liked to see this a little bluer.', '2008-11-13 12:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061965, 738537, 81530, '<td valign="top">no vote</td>', 'no vote', '2008-11-13 12:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
