(5062212, 738621, 34192, '<td valign="top">I think this is very well taken considering the lighting, location, and depth of field required.  However, this does not scream blue, or even whisper blue.  So, while I think you did a wonderful job here, I think you will score poorly in this challenge.  In a group portrait challenge, probably a 6, easy.</td>', 'I think this is very well taken considering the lighting, location, and depth of field required.  However, this does not scream blue, or even whisper blue.  So, while I think you did a wonderful job here, I think you will score poorly in this challenge.  In a group portrait challenge, probably a 6, easy.', '2008-11-13 14:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5062213, 738109, 29148, '<td valign="top">I''m not fond of the composition. Too circular and neat. Good technical work though.</td>', 'I''m not fond of the composition. Too circular and neat. Good technical work though.', '2008-11-13 14:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5062215, 737023, 34192, '<td valign="top">I love the shape of the tree and the tones used but the crop really seems to fight against the art.</td>', 'I love the shape of the tree and the tones used but the crop really seems to fight against the art.', '2008-11-13 14:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
