(5062522, 738221, 42013, '<td valign="top">Hi, ;) I think it''s tough to pull off blue(cool) toned skin and they may be what is holding this one back. It isn''t overtly blue in totality, although certainly as much as many of the entries. focus is sharp which makes DPC happy. I do however find his expression rather bland--you may have been going for a blue ''sad'' look but I''m feeling a little more of the bored look. From a portrait perspective, a little fill light on his face may have helped. Might have also brought out some of the nice color in his shirt.<br/> <br/>I suspect the score reflects a tenuous connection to the challenge in the opinion of the voters. Sorry my comment is rather rambling. PM me if I don''t make sense...</td>', 'Hi, ;) I think it''s tough to pull off blue(cool) toned skin and they may be what is holding this one back. It isn''t overtly blue in totality, although certainly as much as many of the entries. focus is sharp which makes DPC happy. I do however find his expression rather bland--you may have been going for a blue ''sad'' look but I''m feeling a little more of the bored look. From a portrait perspective, a little fill light on his face may have helped. Might have also brought out some of the nice color in his shirt. I suspect the score reflects a tenuous connection to the challenge in the opinion of the voters. Sorry my comment is rather rambling. PM me if I don''t make sense...', '2008-11-13 17:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
