(5063247, 738691, 61396, '<td valign="top">Don''t know about blue (maybe my monitor is not calibrated), but that''s a splendid image. I''m not sure what makes it for me. Maybe the depiction of multiple different objects in close proximity, each having its own unique shape, and yet it''s obvious they are all interconnected. The more I look at it, the more I find it appealing, with its delicate lighting, and the wood and paint textures. Great job, I tell ya. You should consider making a series of such finds.<br/> <br/>(not voting, but sure faving)</td>', 'Don''t know about blue (maybe my monitor is not calibrated), but that''s a splendid image. I''m not sure what makes it for me. Maybe the depiction of multiple different objects in close proximity, each having its own unique shape, and yet it''s obvious they are all interconnected. The more I look at it, the more I find it appealing, with its delicate lighting, and the wood and paint textures. Great job, I tell ya. You should consider making a series of such finds. (not voting, but sure faving)', '2008-11-14 08:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
