(5065259, 738641, 67258, '<td valign="top">Weird rather than surreal; the colour of the wash basin seems white rather than blue - OK, perhaps a hint of blue, but it looks more like an off-white balance.</td>', 'Weird rather than surreal; the colour of the wash basin seems white rather than blue - OK, perhaps a hint of blue, but it looks more like an off-white balance.', '2008-11-15 14:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065262, 736943, 67258, '<td valign="top">A nice idea for the challenge, but the end result falls a little short.  The lack of sharp focus and the high levels of noise would suggest that this was taken hand-held with a slowish shutter speed.  A lower ISO, and even slower shutter-speed either tripod mounted, or securely balanced would, I am sure, have produced a better result.</td>', 'A nice idea for the challenge, but the end result falls a little short.  The lack of sharp focus and the high levels of noise would suggest that this was taken hand-held with a slowish shutter speed.  A lower ISO, and even slower shutter-speed either tripod mounted, or securely balanced would, I am sure, have produced a better result.', '2008-11-15 14:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
