(5065788, 738600, 96614, '<td valign="top">Great shot! It might be my screen calibration, but the dragon fly looks more green than blue... if that''s the case, you can always change the green hue into a blue in camera raw (allowed under basic editing)... IMO if the dragon fly was more blue, then it would score much higher... great sharp focus thought =)</td>', 'Great shot! It might be my screen calibration, but the dragon fly looks more green than blue... if that''s the case, you can always change the green hue into a blue in camera raw (allowed under basic editing)... IMO if the dragon fly was more blue, then it would score much higher... great sharp focus thought =)', '2008-11-15 21:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
