(5065911, 738614, 83313, '<td valign="top">Almost a watercolor look to this. I love the pastel blue tones. Some highlights on the leaf seem a little blown out. If this had been advanced editing a little burning could have probably fixed it. In basic, may be the highlight/shadow adjustments are all you could try on it.</td>', 'Almost a watercolor look to this. I love the pastel blue tones. Some highlights on the leaf seem a little blown out. If this had been advanced editing a little burning could have probably fixed it. In basic, may be the highlight/shadow adjustments are all you could try on it.', '2008-11-15 23:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065912, 738646, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice, very nice. My only minor nitpick is that the glass butts up against the right side of the frame, instead of their being just a touch of space. (I SAID it was minor!)</td>', 'Nice, very nice. My only minor nitpick is that the glass butts up against the right side of the frame, instead of their being just a touch of space. (I SAID it was minor!)', '2008-11-15 23:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
