(5070039, 737986, 83313, '<td valign="top">The swan seems too small in the frame to have any impact with me. Perhaps if the water were still instead of rippled, it might stand out at this distance, but the way it is, it is lost in the background. I''ll bet closer up, there is some wonderful detail to be seen.</td>', 'The swan seems too small in the frame to have any impact with me. Perhaps if the water were still instead of rippled, it might stand out at this distance, but the way it is, it is lost in the background. I''ll bet closer up, there is some wonderful detail to be seen.', '2008-11-18 19:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5070040, 737108, 83313, '<td valign="top">That''s cool looking.</td>', 'That''s cool looking.', '2008-11-18 19:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5070042, 738691, 83313, '<td valign="top">A very subtle blue, almost a gray. I love the texture ans lighting. Some areas seem a little too perfect, though, as if you went a touch heavy on noise reduction.</td>', 'A very subtle blue, almost a gray. I love the texture ans lighting. Some areas seem a little too perfect, though, as if you went a touch heavy on noise reduction.', '2008-11-18 19:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5070044, 738631, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this does not come off to me well. The composition seems awkward, with my eye led to the very upper edge, where the duck''s face is hidden in shadow.</td>', 'I''m afraid this does not come off to me well. The composition seems awkward, with my eye led to the very upper edge, where the duck''s face is hidden in shadow.', '2008-11-18 19:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5070046, 736900, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like your humor here. The shot itself needs some improvement, I''m afraid. <br/> <br/>1) the background is very busy and draws my eye away from cookie monster.<br/> <br/>2)Details seem unclear, especially on cookie monsters fur. I think some of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 70k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing some of the detail from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)</td>', 'I like your humor here. The shot itself needs some improvement, I''m afraid.  1) the background is very busy and draws my eye away from cookie monster. 2)Details seem unclear, especially on cookie monsters fur. I think some of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 70k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing some of the detail from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)', '2008-11-18 19:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5070047, 737218, 65234, '<td valign="top">I don''t think "blue" when I see this, I think "sick."  Mucous coming out of a child''s nose ... anyone''s nose ... is not something I want to see.  If he had the same expression and no nasal drip I could accept it working as a feeling blue kind of shot, but not in its current incarnation.</td>', 'I don''t think "blue" when I see this, I think "sick."  Mucous coming out of a child''s nose ... anyone''s nose ... is not something I want to see.  If he had the same expression and no nasal drip I could accept it working as a feeling blue kind of shot, but not in its current incarnation.', '2008-11-18 19:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
