(5070693, 738482, 42013, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by aliqui:</b></div><hr/><i> This is stunning. I think there''s too much dead space at the top. I know you wanted to keep the top right bird, but I think the image would be more powerful without the top inch. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Just had to keep the top bird. :) I went with squarish crop to maximize the pixels.</td>', 'Originally posted by aliqui: This is stunning. I think there''s too much dead space at the top. I know you wanted to keep the top right bird, but I think the image would be more powerful without the top inch.   Just had to keep the top bird. :) I went with squarish crop to maximize the pixels.', '2008-11-19 01:17:14.000000', NULL, 0),
