(5072101, 738610, 34192, '<td valign="top">I''m not surprised by the final score - typical DPC.  Just wanted to let you know that this image speaks more to me about life, time, and space, than most images in the challenge.  While this is not a ''pretty picture,'' it is a strong image that tells me a story, gives me an idea into the head of the photographer.  That is worth so much more than another sparkly shiny object on a blank background.</td>', 'I''m not surprised by the final score - typical DPC.  Just wanted to let you know that this image speaks more to me about life, time, and space, than most images in the challenge.  While this is not a ''pretty picture,'' it is a strong image that tells me a story, gives me an idea into the head of the photographer.  That is worth so much more than another sparkly shiny object on a blank background.', '2008-11-19 09:13:55.000000', NULL, 0),
