(5072110, 737923, 96664, '<td valign="top">Very surprised this one got 5th... I thought I would be a ribbon no problem... Lets just say you got a ribbon in my eyes!!! I came back to this shot expecting to find why it got 5th but I still can''t figure it out... I see NO flaws with it! Great job and I hope you can post some more like this... Absolutely wonderful!</td>', 'Very surprised this one got 5th... I thought I would be a ribbon no problem... Lets just say you got a ribbon in my eyes!!! I came back to this shot expecting to find why it got 5th but I still can''t figure it out... I see NO flaws with it! Great job and I hope you can post some more like this... Absolutely wonderful!', '2008-11-19 09:18:15.000000', NULL, 0),
