(5072362, 738033, 83313, '<td valign="top">As expected, a pure abstract usually scores pretty low. I think this one was underrated, but at least the voters are consistent. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=734693" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">This  similar looking entry by Freakin_Hilarious</a> in the motion blur challenge scored almost identically.<br/> <br/>Don''t let the averages discourage you. Looking at the voting breakdown, I can see that 50 people (22% of the voters) felt it was worthy of a 6 or higher. There are plenty who like abstracts, even if it is not a majority.</td>', 'As expected, a pure abstract usually scores pretty low. I think this one was underrated, but at least the voters are consistent. This  similar looking entry by Freakin_Hilarious in the motion blur challenge scored almost identically. Don''t let the averages discourage you. Looking at the voting breakdown, I can see that 50 people (22% of the voters) felt it was worthy of a 6 or higher. There are plenty who like abstracts, even if it is not a majority.', '2008-11-19 11:02:51.000000', NULL, 0),
