(6063719, 738482, 66597, '<td valign="top">Mark, just added this to faves. This is evocative, extremely well composed... just beautiful. Weird question, though: is the horizon slightly askew by any chance? If so, it doesn''t change the photo much, but for some reason (may be just my eye) it looks like it needs to be slightly tilted to the right.</td>', 'Mark, just added this to faves. This is evocative, extremely well composed... just beautiful. Weird question, though: is the horizon slightly askew by any chance? If so, it doesn''t change the photo much, but for some reason (may be just my eye) it looks like it needs to be slightly tilted to the right.', '2010-06-21 00:19:02.000000', NULL, 0),
